error: chained comparison on the left side parses as `(a op b) op c`, not as a math-style chain
 --> Lua54:1:11
1 | local x = a < b == c
  |           ^^^^^^^^^^
help: split into two boolean expressions joined with `and`, or parenthesize to make intent explicit

error: chained comparison on the left side parses as `(a op b) op c`, not as a math-style chain
 --> Lua54:1:11
1 | local x = a == b == c
  |           ^^^^^^^^^^^
help: split into two boolean expressions joined with `and`, or parenthesize to make intent explicit

error: chained comparison on the left side parses as `(a op b) op c`, not as a math-style chain
 --> Lua54:1:11
1 | local x = a < b < c
  |           ^^^^^^^^^
help: split into two boolean expressions joined with `and`, or parenthesize to make intent explicit

error: `not` applies only to the left operand, so this parses as `(not x) == y`
 --> Lua54:1:11
1 | local x = not a == b
  |           ^^^^^^^^^^
help: consider `x ~= y`, or add parentheses to make intent explicit

